# TOWN SQUARE, MEDICAL & HERO EQUIPMENT SYSTEM

## Overview

Equipment adalah item yang dapat dibuat melalui fasilitas di **Town Square**, **Medical Facility**, dan **Hero Equipment Workshop**.

```text
MATERIAL
   ↓
CRAFTING RECIPE
   ↓
TOWN / MEDICAL / HERO FACILITY
   ↓
EQUIPMENT
   ↓
HERO / TOWN
```

Equipment dibagi menjadi:

```text
TOWN SQUARE EQUIPMENT
├── Blacksmith Equipment
├── Workshop Equipment
├── Carpenter Equipment
├── Tailor Equipment
├── General Tools
├── Storage Equipment
└── Facility Equipment

MEDICAL EQUIPMENT
├── Medical Tools
├── Recovery Equipment
├── Treatment Equipment
├── Medicine Equipment
├── Laboratory Equipment
└── Advanced Medical Equipment

HERO EQUIPMENT
├── Weapons
├── Armor
├── Helmets
├── Gloves
├── Boots
├── Accessories
├── Shields
├── Talismans
├── Skill Equipment
├── Consumable Equipment
└── Expedition Equipment
```

