# 21. HERO EQUIPMENT REFINEMENT

Refinement meningkatkan kualitas atau bonus equipment.

```text
Refinement Level:
0–10
```

Contoh:

```text
Steel Sword +0
Physical Damage +5%

Steel Sword Refine +3
Physical Damage +8%

Steel Sword Refine +6
Physical Damage +12%

Steel Sword Refine +10
Physical Damage +18%
```

Refinement dapat memiliki risiko:

```text
Refinement 0–5:
Tidak ada risiko

Refinement 6–8:
Equipment dapat gagal diperkuat

Refinement 9–10:
Equipment dapat kehilangan level refinement
```

Item perlindungan dapat digunakan:

```text
Refinement Protection Stone
Equipment Protection Scroll
Safe Refinement Ticket
```

